 "purpose": "B6 and B62 (docs/OSS_CORPUS.md): the transitive packages of a repo mapping manifest include those of an output file's generating rule (its exec tool), of select() keys and of a select() key's config_setting's constraint_values and their constraint_setting. Genuine Bazel 9.3.1 capture; tests/runfiles_trees.rs repo_mapping_manifests_include_generating_rules_and_select_keys asserts these bytes.",
